{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Gems-gif-ezgif.com-cropA.gif?t=1745297532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hex Blast</strong> is a <strong>horde survival x roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where you strategize on a hex grid, chaining explosive card combos to wipe out cyber hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Gems-gif-ezgif.com-cropB.gif?t=1745297532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Boot up your robot\u2014each with unique abilities and a customizable deck\u2014to firewall your core systems against relentless viral hordes!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Characters_withglow.png?t=1745297532\" />Discover devastating synergies: Shatter the battlefield with earthquake builds, transform defense into offense with shield fortresses, or engineer entirely new combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck, acquire powerful chips, and refine the ultimate engine to outsmart ever-adapting cyber threats\u2014before they overwhelm you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 Playable Robots</strong> - each with their own unique cards and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>200+ cards and relics</strong> - infinite synergies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Hex Grid</strong> - position cards for explosive chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolving cyber threats</strong> - adapt as enemies mutate into deadlier forms and swarm in relentless waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless replayability</strong> - no two runs play the same</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463290?t=1745297532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/ca330b813d91a71569838b9294b748704380b51e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745297532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/53ea1ff76019be11bfbf68f7d1c1467a97c97395/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745297532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/53ea1ff76019be11bfbf68f7d1c1467a97c97395/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745297532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Gems-gif-ezgif.com-cropA.gif?t=1745297532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hex Blast</strong> is a <strong>horde survival x roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where you strategize on a hex grid, chaining explosive card combos to wipe out cyber hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Gems-gif-ezgif.com-cropB.gif?t=1745297532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Boot up your robot\u2014each with unique abilities and a customizable deck\u2014to firewall your core systems against relentless viral hordes!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/Characters_withglow.png?t=1745297532\" />Discover devastating synergies: Shatter the battlefield with earthquake builds, transform defense into offense with shield fortresses, or engineer entirely new combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck, acquire powerful chips, and refine the ultimate engine to outsmart ever-adapting cyber threats\